DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     This command forces all in-core dirty data to be written to the primary
     pool storage and not the ZIL.  It will also update administrative infor‐
     mation including quota reporting.  Without arguments, zzppooooll ssyynncc will
     sync all pools on the system.  Otherwise, it will sync only the specified
     pools.

